  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Korea Trust Fund for Economic and Peacebuilding Transitions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The two main objectives of the proposed trust fund would be: (i) to  support measures to improve governance and institutional performance  in countries emerging from, or at risk of sliding into crisis or  arrears; and (ii) to support the reconstruction and development of  countries prone to, in, or emerging from conflict.  The objectives of  this single-donor trust fund are consistent with the Bank&apos;s overall  support to fragile and conflict-affected countries, including the  multi-donor State and Peace Building Fund (SPF). In agreement with the  donor, about 20% of funds may be made available for Regions other than  EAP.</narrative>
  </description>
